64.5771-25/473392165_644807838151239_4095123170535035691_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o2sbRUjfVZoQ7kNvwGPgkyQ&_nc_oc=AdocVG4t3KVcu6e8rfGaw9H96FiN9fonaP0Ca1AtXQA-PWXj3_nBtRtnwxk5b1U0FpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0_6h9x-J0c-lG7myXxq4-bUEb9EVpE_BL8WsgeoC7V-A&oe=69E8AEC7"}, {"file_name": "896976.png", "id": "505172455968203", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392052_505172459301536_9114790666962688767_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z-I8OdZA0G8Q7kNvwFJOqWa&_nc_oc=AdpWp_PEUPP6DLFDZXsryPQmmaz6U5pIKfYSlDIYc21X_iy-QX7H8iMSj6saILS4ZUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3dcAi8vXMAvJUWp8oTpSBgdBkBOvNBHPoIcOZqpbsdPA&oe=69E8D0E8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Certified EV Technician", "keywords": ["EV", "Battery", "Immerselearn", "Training"], "long_description": "Certified EV Technician is an advanced VR training app designed to provide hands-on experience in electric vehicle technology. This interactive simulation covers:\n\n-Types of EVs\n-Battery Technology\n-Electric Motors \n\nTrain in a realistic, risk-free virtual environment to develop critical skills in EV maintenance, troubleshooting, and technology. Whether you're an aspiring technician or a professional looking to enhance your expertise, Certified EV Technician equips you with the knowledge and practical experience needed for the growing EV industry. Start your training today!", "short_description": "Step into the future of automotive technology with Certified EV Technician! This immersive VR training app provides hands-on experience with EV types, battery technology, and electric motors. Learn essential skills in a realistic virtual environment to enhance safety, efficiency, and technical expertise. Perfect for aspiring EV technicians and professionals looking to upskill in the evolving electric vehicle industry."}]}, "developer_name"